cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research record, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Genomic and Molecular Analysis of a 17p13.3 Microdeletion and Its Candidate Visual-Neurological Mechanisms"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Laing"
    given-names: "Zachariah P."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-8765-4601"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-30"
license: "CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0"
abstract: >-
  Complete first-pass in silico research record evaluating the genomic structure,
  molecular mechanisms, spatiotemporal expression, dosage and perturbation evidence,
  candidate visual-neurological mechanisms, deterministic evidence integration, and
  causal evidence boundaries of a heterozygous 17p13.3 microdeletion at GRCh37/hg19
  chr17:1,411,408-1,841,103.
keywords:
  - 17p13.3
  - microdeletion
  - copy-number variation
  - phosphoinositides
  - retina
  - neurodevelopment
  - bioinformatics
  - photosensitivity
repository-code: "https://github.com/LZP2025-GIT/17p13.3-microdeletion-research"
